WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.694
Naimark's problem, without extra axioms.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.123
Separable examples are always the compact operators.

3
00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:08.946
Extra set theory gave a strange exception.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.535
Build it in uncountably many steps, each making old pure states equivalent.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.491
Claimed: one exists using only standard axioms.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.285
Lean-checked main theorem.
